# Swift FSRS Package - Complete API Reference for LLMs

## Package Overview
Swift-FSRS is a Swift implementation of the FSRS-5.0 (Free Spaced Repetition Scheduler) algorithm, a modern spaced repetition algorithm for flashcard applications. It calculates optimal review intervals based on memory stability and difficulty.

---

## Core Concepts

### Card States
- **`.new`** (0): Card has never been reviewed
- **`.learning`** (1): Card is in initial learning phase (short-term)
- **`.review`** (2): Card is in long-term review phase
- **`.relearning`** (3): Card was forgotten and is being relearned

### Ratings
- **`.manual`** (0): Manual rating (used for special operations like forget)
- **`.again`** (1): Failed to recall
- **`.hard`** (2): Recalled with difficulty
- **`.good`** (3): Recalled correctly
- **`.easy`** (4): Recalled easily

