### 6. **RescheduleOptions** (Struct)

Options for rescheduling operations.

```swift
public struct RescheduleOptions {
    var recordLogHandler: ((RecordLogItem?) -> RecordLogItem?)?
    var reviewsOrderBy: ((ReviewLog, ReviewLog) -> Bool)?
